{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/793858-creating-monsters-how-do-they-do-it","id":793858,"title":"Creating Monsters: How do they do it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-27T17:31:32-08:00","id":793858,"title":"Creating Monsters: How do they do it?","content":"So anybody who knows anything about mythology knows that it is full of stories about Gods turning people into monsters (such as Athena cursing Medusa), but I don't see any specifics on how to do this in the Scion universe. There are references to characters who have done so, but nothing specific on how. The closest I can find are the Animal and Jotunblut purviews that allow you to make Chimeras and Giants at really high levels.<br /> <br /> In Demigod, there is one Scion (Ixion) who is responsible for the creation of many Titanspawn, but again, it doesn't say how he did so.<br /> <br /> <br /> So if I wanted to play a Scion who goes around turning people into monsters, how would I do it in game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-28-2015, 05:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T19:04:23-08:00","id":793886,"title":"","content":"So far the closest in Scion is the Reshape Shen (Taiyi 10) ability in Companion or the Transform Person spell (here <a href=\"http://scion-mmp.wikidot.com/magic-purview\" target=\"_blank\">http://scion-mmp.wikidot.com/magic-purview</a>). In effect most of them were just cursing mortals, which they did a lot of when they were mad. I'm hoping 2nd edition comes up with mechanics for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/333-achilles","name":"Achilles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar333_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T19:10:04-08:00","id":793887,"title":"","content":"In Ixion Case there is a Unique power called &quot;Create Monstrosity&quot; on his character Sheet used mostly as a Plot Device... not the most elegant solution<br /> <br /> For your monster Making PC I will Sugest: &quot;Transform Person&quot; Magic Spell (Magic 7) wich allow you to use your own Self Transfoming Powers on another person Most of them are Animal (3) but there are 2 Moon 1 Earth, Fire, Fertility and War.<br /> <br /> I Seam to Remember a Moon power related to Lycantropy but i can not find it... maybe it was Fan-Made<br /> <br /> Healt 8 &quot;Human Clay&quot; lets you &quot;esculpt&quot; the body of others, while it limits you to &quot;human&quot; changes (so you can not Sculpt Wings or Claws) you can do all Kinds of Hunchback, Conjointed Freeks. then you use &quot;Transform Person&quot; and your Animal Boons to give them Wings and Claws<br /> <br /> Then you can Always have a Special Unique power for your Relics, While trying to Emulate a power like &quot;transform person&quot; or &quot;Human Clay&quot; may be to Expensive for a Relic that can go beyond 5 you can lower the ranks of your Hipotetic power by Sacrificing Versatility and/or Adding Drawbacks<br /> <br /> <br /> Finaly, and this is a Little Outside the Box you can find Titanspawns that Reproduce by turning Humans (In opose of good old fashion sexual reproduction) and find a way to Mass produce and Brainwach the new Titanspawn <br /> <br /> Cyclops Medusae All of the Undead (Vampires) All Theriantropes (Were-Stuff) <br /> <br /> So go ahead, Capture one of the Two Gorgons and keep it alive to harvest her blood to create Medusae, Then use Large Amounts of &quot;Transform Person&quot; &quot;Animal Feature&quot; and &quot;Human Clay&quot; to make the monsters more Personalized to your taste and go give the Titans a taste of their own medicine (unless you get Horribly fatebound and end up corrupted on the way)<br /> <br /> off course most of this will not Kick out until late Demigod, so you may want to Start whit a more generic aproch early on Hero... A lot of Followers (to volounteer for the transformation later) War and Jotunblut <br /> <br /> so thats it, Animal Healt Magic War and Jotunblut, that is how i would made a monster making Character... <br /> <br /> A Demigod NPC Nazi Scientist Corrupted Scion, will be the most Cliche thing ever. but i love Cliches <br /> <br /> (now i need to fless him out and post it on your other post of acendent Scions)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4856-alfanumerico","name":"alfanumerico","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T19:59:23-08:00","id":793907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>alfanumerico</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/793858-creating-monsters-how-do-they-do-it?p=793887#post793887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Demigod NPC Nazi Scientist Corrupted Scion, will be the most Cliche thing ever. but i love Cliches<br /> <br /> (now i need to fless him out and post it on your other post of acendent Scions)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Isn't that one of the characters in the World War 2 downloaded Chronicle? He's a Scion of Hephaestus who experiments with an enslaved Frost Giant's blood to create an army of Nazi super soldiers.<br /> <br /> <br /> --------------------------<br /> <br /> But what I was going for was more along the line of creating actual monsters and possibly even brand new species. Not simply imitating their appearance. For example, Athena didn't just make Medusa look like a snake, she gave her the power to turn people to stone if they looked at her. Some unknown Titan modified the rabies virus to create the first Therianthropes and from there the infection spread into multiple different strains.<br /> <br /> Mythology is chock full of all kinds of stories of Gods turning people into supernatural creatures of legend, and I find it more than a bit disappointing that Scion does not allow us to do the same outside of &quot;plot convenience&quot; related exceptions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-27-2015, 11:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T20:31:24-08:00","id":793920,"title":"","content":"As a last resort, there is always the Loki way: sex! Doesn't give you much control over when or what kind of monster you get, though...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T20:37:12-08:00","id":793922,"title":"","content":"Haven\u00b4t read the Downloaded Chronicles yet... so i haven\u00b4t heard of that character... that being said i do recognize the character being a Total Cliche so the probability of someone else already making it was high<br /> <br /> but im not just using Titanspawn blood to replicate the Titanspawns but also using &quot;Transform Person&quot; &quot;Animal Feature&quot; and &quot;Human Clay&quot; to further evolved into my characters own version of said Monsters (kind of like how Ixion Change Horse for Motorcycle whit his new horseman)<br /> <br /> that being said i dont know if there are ways of granting Boons, maybe it is posible whit the True Companions mechanic... i am not sure... but that requires the other character to be a fatebond true companion not just a randomly created monster<br /> <br /> Maybe Athena Used &quot;The Arbiter&quot; Justice Avatar, and granting him the &quot;Turn People into Stone&quot; was a form of Poetic Justice, since her beauty was the one responsable for the transgresion i don\u00b4t know once you reach Legend 12 and &quot;Avatar State&quot; rules are out the Window maybe you can use The Beast or The Green to create entire new species of Animals and Plants<br /> <br /> Then there is War 10 &quot;Surreal Draft&quot; that create this definitly not human soldiers, if you convine this boon whit animal you get Antropomorphic Beasts, maybe one of this got the rabies and that mutated into Theriantropy... once you hit god things get realy crazy so i don\u00b4t know<br /> <br /> <br /> but going by the character you asked for &quot;goes around turning people into monsters&quot; waiting until Godhood and Avatar State may not be the way to go... the way i described is at demigod (mostly) still not the ideal... but creating new Medusas or Basilisk is not something that should be posible for a Hero","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4856-alfanumerico","name":"alfanumerico","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T22:27:45-08:00","id":793963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/793858-creating-monsters-how-do-they-do-it?p=793920#post793920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As a last resort, there is always the Loki way: sex! Doesn't give you much control over when or what kind of monster you get, though...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I had an idea of somebody tracking down the tied up Fenrir and &quot;acquiring&quot; some of his divine seed to create a Scion of Loki. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> But yeah, I wasn't expecting a Hero to be capable of pervading the natural order... anymore than usual. I was simply curious to know if there was <i>eventually</i> a way to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-28-2015, 01:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T11:40:13-08:00","id":794291,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure there's a Demigod-level Magic Spell that lets you turn people into animals. Not monsters, though. For that, you need to be a God. There are Boons in Animal, Chaos, Health and Fertility that cover the transformation of others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T11:57:57-08:00","id":794305,"title":"","content":"There is a 10 dot Health boon that lets you create new humans from a blood/tissue sample, if you have samples from 2 or more people, the results will be a combination of the donor's traits. If you have the 10 dot Animal Boon, you can create your own Chimaera(gryphons and such); Fertility has &quot;Impossible Hybrid&quot;, that lets you combine any 2 types of plant; both of these can be used in combination with the 10 Health boon to make Human/Animal or Human/Plant creatures, and finally, Chaos has &quot;Unintended Purpose&quot;; that can fuse machines in place of body parts; if you have all 4, you can make some pretty crazy shit!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T12:24:57-08:00","id":794323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/793858-creating-monsters-how-do-they-do-it?p=794305#post794305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a 10 dot Health boon that lets you create new humans from a blood/tissue sample, if you have samples from 2 or more people, the results will be a combination of the donor's traits. If you have the 10 dot Animal Boon, you can create your own Chimaera(gryphons and such); Fertility has &quot;Impossible Hybrid&quot;, that lets you combine any 2 types of plant; both of these can be used in combination with the 10 Health boon to make Human/Animal or Human/Plant creatures, and finally, Chaos has &quot;Unintended Purpose&quot;; that can fuse machines in place of body parts; if you have all 4, you can make some pretty crazy shit!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Le thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T13:45:57-08:00","id":794368,"title":"","content":"Yes, overall it seems like Ixion monster-making abilities are some sort of boost by the Titans that lets him access the aforementioned boons at Legend 8.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}